OL,3,GNEWSACharity buildings from 17th
OL,4,ACentury to become 'affordable' homes
OL,5,Afor young people
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnglesey council has now granted
OL,8,Fpermission for plans to convert the
OL,9,Ffive existing residential properties
OL,10,Finto three, to create rental housing
OL,11,Fthat enables residents to save for
OL,12,Ffuture home-ownership.
